=== rcs-cat-string
cmd $ROOT/src/atari/rcs.rsc cat /.strings/#1
out
|  Hide Parts          \x07P

=== rcs-images
cmd $ROOT/src/atari/rcs.rsc ls -l /.images
out
|#0     CLIPMPTY     48x44
|#1     CLIPFULL     48x44

